# ######################################################################## #
# File:     .dev/config/doc/group-section-mappings.PSV
#
# Purpose:  Maps Full Group Form (FGF) Doxygen \name titles to Simplified
#           Group Form (SGF) group names, for
#           .dev/bin/convert-doxy-groups.rb.
#
# Created:  30th May 2006
# Updated:  14th November 2026
#
# Format:   <fgf-title>|<sgf-name>[|<sgf-alias>]...
#
#           * the first column is the FGF title; the second is the
#             canonical SGF name (written when converting FGF->SGF);
#             any further columns are SGF aliases, which are accepted
#             when converting SGF->FGF but are reported (and may be
#             fixed to the canonical name) by --validate;
#           * no column may be blank;
#           * every SGF name and alias must be lowercase, and may
#             contain spaces;
#           * every <fgf-title>, and every SGF name or alias (across all
#             lines), must be unique, so that the mapping is reversible;
#           * blank lines and lines beginning with '#' are ignored;
#           * entries are sorted lexicographically (case-insensitively)
#             by <fgf-title>.
#
# ######################################################################## #

Accessors|accessors
Allocation|allocation
Assignment|assignment
Attributes|attributes
Comparison|comparison
Concepts|concepts
Construction|construction
Conversion|conversion|conversions
Directory End|directory end
Dynamic Library Functions|dynamic library functions|dl functions
Element Access|element access
Environment|environment|env
